# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Generated at build or install time --------------------------------------
# Compiled translations — generated from the .ts files, see Docs/03-i18n.md
gentstore/i18n/*.qm

# --- Prototype and specification material ------------------------------------
# The design mock-up and the original functional brief. They shaped the project
# but nothing in it reads them: every token, screen and rule that mattered was
# copied into Docs/. Kept locally, out of the repository.
#
# prompt-*.md also covers the briefs written for one piece of work at a time.
# Those are notes to a reader, not to the program, and they are the one place
# in this tree written in Polish; what they establish belongs in the commit
# message or in Docs/, where it can be found without them.
Gentoo portage UI prototype.zip
prompt-*.md
*.dc.html

# The design canvas the website was built from, delivered as an archive. Same
# reasoning as the prototype above: the layout, the copy and the screen list it
# carried are in website/, where they are served rather than unpacked.
Web/

# --- Tooling caches and test leftovers ---------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Local editor / tooling noise --------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
.DS_Store

# --- Runtime output ----------------------------------------------------------
# The application logs to ~/.local/state/gentstore/, but a stray run redirected
# into the working tree should not become a commit.
*.log
